# Git metadata (submodule gitfiles included); the image gets versions via the
# manifest, not via git history.
.git
.gitmodules
**/.git

# ... with ONE exception, and it is load-bearing rather than a convenience.
# packaging-flow records the identity of every package it dispatches by running
# `git rev-parse HEAD` on the directory find_spec resolves to. The staged trees
# are installed editable, so that directory is staging/<name>, and without its
# .git the identity is recorded as "unavailable: not a git checkout", which
# `packaging-flow verify` refuses at the full tier. `**/.git` above would strip
# exactly that. Each staged .git is one shallow commit, 5.8 MB for all eight.
!staging/*/.git

# bin/flow and bin/adk-vscode are host launchers: they start the image or VS
# Code, so the image has no use for them (tests/flow checks that this keeps
# them out of the context).
bin/flow
bin/adk-vscode

# Host build artifacts: everything compiles inside the image
tools/kicad/build
tools/chiplet-studio/build
tools/chiplet-studio/extern/klayout/build-release
tools/chiplet-studio/extern/klayout/bin-release
tools/chiplet-studio/extern/klayout/build-debug
tools/chiplet-studio/extern/klayout/bin-debug

# Python noise
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache

# Test scratch: gds_to_kicad writes these under tests/ at runtime (git-ignored in
# that submodule, so the superproject .dockerignore must catch them explicitly);
# no tracked fixture lives at tests/*.gds, so this bakes nothing intended.
tools/gds_to_kicad/tests/test_*.gds
# Its local venv and build output, git-ignored there for the same reason.
tools/gds_to_kicad/build
tools/gds_to_kicad/venv

# Generated at build time / local files. SESSION_LOG.md is matched at every
# depth on purpose: a submodule checkout keeps its own at its repo root, and a
# bare pattern only matches the context root.
manifest.json
*.log
**/SESSION_LOG.md

# Notes that three tool repos keep untracked and gitignore (`docs/`).
# They still sit in a working checkout, and .dockerignore is an exclude list
# over the working tree, not over the git index, so without these lines they get
# baked into the image and an image built here differs from one built from a
# clean clone. Listed one by one on purpose: a future tool with a TRACKED docs/
# that the image needs must not be swept up by a `tools/*/docs` wildcard.
tools/adk/docs
tools/chiplet-studio/docs
tools/gds_to_kicad/docs

# OpenROAD sidecar: host-side only, never copied into the image. Excluding it
# also keeps a 3 GB managed OpenROAD checkout out of the build context.
openroad

# Demo / project artifacts: never bake a developer's local heavy/scratch output
# into the image. Mirrors .gitignore (the verify stage regenerates everything;
# the tracked light deliverables -- the .chiplet + MANIFEST.md at the outputs/
# root, the _interposer.gds + *.json sidecars under outputs/layout/, and the
# reports under outputs/reports/ -- are intentionally NOT matched here so they
# travel into the image).
examples/**/outputs/layout/*_complete.gds
examples/**/outputs/*.hyp
examples/**/outputs/reports/assembly_drc
examples/**/outputs/logs
examples/**/*-backups
examples/**/fp-info-cache
examples/**/*.kicad_prl
examples/**/_autosave-*
examples/**/*.lck
